7269feb8d5692fbe005b33cd6b4651cf979b25c3 blob 3303
# B0-r2 executable source packet for independent preexecution review

No actual39-call authorization is present. All product/consumer/install/Worker/
engine calls remain UNRUN. Large StageB requirements remain separate and intact.

`LOCATOR-IDENTITIES.json` binds the two separately named roles to stored blobs:
StageA ab976f5e/stage-a-r2/PRESEAL.json/47291B/8acc5e35;
fixture955e7eb7/v4/PRESEAL.json/8922B/4911f32f. Full identities are in PROFILE.md.
Development Git type/size verification preceded body admission for BOTH tuples.
No expected identity was replaced with an observed value. Original7dc STOP stays.

`PRESEAL.json` and `SEAL.json` bind executable sources, unchanged15k fixture,
source309/tool2274/link12 authorities, StageA1012 emissions and full1014 package.
New controller entry/bootstrap and runner are syntax-checked only; six DATA
admission assertions test exact positives, swapped-locator pre-open refusals,
wrong-size pre-open refusal and wrong hash. Harmless child fixture count is0.

Exact future command (ROOT must separately authorize and reviewer supply seal):

    B0_ROOT_GO=ROOT_B0_39_EXPLICIT_FRESH_AUTHORIZATION /bin/zsh tests/integration/agent-bash-coherent-author-20260829/stage-b0-r2/launch.sh tests/integration/agent-bash-coherent-author-20260829/stage-b0-r2/PRESEAL.json SHA256_FROM_SEAL_JSON BYTES_FROM_SEAL_JSON

Four supervised roles: genuine offline npm install and three13-case consumers,
source-built from actual retained StageA dist, installed, then physically moved.
No build/TS dispatch. Runner ordinary assertion rows aggregate; cleanup/deadline/
integrity failures stop dependent work. Capture opens before child dispatch.
Common supervisor is exact StageA e56e611e, not a new universal cleanup proof.

Scripts do not explicitly invoke regex commands, but do not label engine-free
as Worker-free: retained qualified public80 Regex parent permits only selected
regex entry,2/layout6total,live2. Three internal Node loader admissions are
separate. Nodeguest entry activation is denied. Worker nested imports rely on
authenticated static closure, not newly observed nested-load instrumentation.
Per-file main-loader admission and complete package pre/post/new-entry guards
remain; inherited next()-reread/host-TOCTOU limitations are disclosed.

`PROFILE.md` specifies fixed source/package,13 IDs, unchanged contexts/expected
effects, public exec/dispose identity, proposed30-minute inclusive resource and
publication budget, install/move/path/permission policy and cleanup qualifications.
All50 Unit2/layout and other retained/types/mutants/PUBLIC95 roles stay mandatory
later. This packet is not coherent acceptance or a wholeHEAD test result.

Captured ordinary helper failures: prepare's `tuples` variable typo after its
input validations; dependent seal then lacked PREP-DATA.json. Both outputs are
retained. `finish.mjs` is a versioned source/DATA correction, not a product or
fixture change and not a hidden retry of a runtime cohort. No script expectations
were changed. `PREPARATION-RESULT.json` states elapsed/start/work qualifications.
Known/admin starts are conservatively bounded47/48 including publication; this
is not a complete kernel descendant census. No independent process-group sweep
is inferred from synchronous preparation tool return.

